{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"音视频回顾","type":"doc","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260909231707-nhkm1no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231707-nhkm1no","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果点中的是 QPushButton，按钮会先处理按下，再处理抬起\n如果按下和抬起都发生在按钮区域内，Qt 就认为这是一次有效点击，然后发出 clicked() 信号\n这个信号如果连了槽函数，槽函数就会执行"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-7y472k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-7y472k0","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"所以整条链路就是：操作系统发消息，Qt 分发事件，按钮发信号，槽函数响应"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-paxcwzh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-paxcwzh","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"讲一下 Qt 中你核心掌握的内容"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-l4t3hk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-l4t3hk3","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"我在 Qt 里核心掌握的是 UI 开发、信号槽、事件机制、线程通信，还有项目工程化这一套"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-qg71hmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-qg71hmr","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先说最常用的，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"界面开发这块我比较熟"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，包括 QWidget 体系、布局管理、.ui 设计、QSS 样式这些，能比较快地把界面搭起来，也知道怎么把界面和业务逻辑拆开。\n第二块是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"信号槽和事件机制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，因为 Qt 很多交互本质上都是靠这套在跑，我比较清楚事件循环、事件分发、控件响应，以及信号槽在解耦模块里的作用。\n第三块是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"线程和线程间通信"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，像 QThread、QueuedConnection、QTimer 这些我用得比较多，知道怎么把耗时任务放到子线程，以及怎么安全地回到 UI 线程更新界面。\n另外就是 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"工程层面的能力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，比如资源系统、文件读写、网络模块、模块拆分这些，我也比较熟，能把 Qt 当成一个完整客户端框架来用，不只是停留在写界面。"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-kkyz5y4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-kkyz5y4","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你的项目中多线程是怎么实现的？如何交互？"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-fdfdzq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-fdfdzq8","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"QThread"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"把耗时的音视频处理放到子线程里，UI 线程只负责界面显示和用户交互"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n因为像解码、录制、推流、读音频帧这些操作都比较重，如果放在主线程，界面就会卡"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-52di7o2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-52di7o2","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目里像 VideoPlayer、SaveVideoFileThread 都是继承 QThread 来跑后台任务的\n比如播放器线程负责解码和同步，录制线程负责采集和写文件，主线程这边只接收结果然后更新界面"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-relxvxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-relxvxs","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程之间的交互，主要靠"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"Qt 的信号槽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n子线程处理完一帧图像、状态变化或者进度更新后，会发信号给界面层\n界面层通过 QueuedConnection 接收，这样槽函数会安全地在 UI 线程执行\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以这套交互本质上就是：子线程干重活，信号槽传结果，UI 线程只做显示和响应"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260909231747-ncjnlo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231747-ncjnlo7","updated":"20260909231747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"项目里凡是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"碰 UI 或"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"QTimer"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"  "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"的地方，我都尽量切回主线程处理\n避免跨线程直接操作界面，这是 Qt 多线程里很关键的点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-iy733v3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-iy733v3","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对 Qt 框架整体理解"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-0mj3r6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-0mj3r6h","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt 是基于 C++ 的跨平台一站式图形应用开发框架\n支持桌面、嵌入式、车载工控等多平台一次开发多处部署"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-5q1uvp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-5q1uvp9","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"核心特性是信号与槽机制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，实现"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"控件与业务逻辑低耦合"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通信替代传统回调\n交互简洁易维护"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-vwoji4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-vwoji4v","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时 Qt "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内置"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络、多线程、串口、数据库、绘图等完整"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"模块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，无需大量第三方依赖"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-csbg7mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-csbg7mn","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构上 Qt 严格遵循 MVC 设计模式：\nModel 管理数据与业务逻辑\nView 负责界面展示交互\nController 处理事件转发、数据更新与视图刷新\n实现界面、数据、逻辑完全分离，代码结构清晰、易于维护扩展"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-0nj5a2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-0nj5a2k","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt 中：Model 管数据，View 显界面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"信号与槽担当 Controller"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，实现 MVC 三层分离"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-vpb5emv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-vpb5emv","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"View 和 Model 存在一定依赖 数据更新需要手动编写"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nView 和 Model 存在一定依赖\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"是指 Qt 的视图控件必须绑定对应的模型才能显示数据\n视图依赖模型提供数据源"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-7phhgw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-7phhgw1","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据更新需要手动编写，是指视图和模型的自动同步只限于界面展示\n真正的数据校验、存储、业务逻辑处理，都需要我们开发者手动通过信号槽去编写实现"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-jfomr9e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-jfomr9e","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用了哪些 qt 控件？"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-kc8gc4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-kc8gc4p","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"视频显示控件我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"自定义了一个 MyOpenGLWidget，继承自 QOpenGLWidget"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重写了初始化和绘制函数，用 GPU 硬件加速渲染 YUV 数据"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这样播放高清视频不卡顿，专门用来显示直播和本地视频"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-zc4izs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-zc4izs9","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QMainWindow "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"做主窗口，放菜单和工具栏\n用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QDialog "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"做登录、推流、拉流这些弹窗\n用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QTabWidget"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 做登录注册切换\n用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" QGroupBox"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分组显示，让界面更清晰"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-jhne6fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-jhne6fd","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"交互控件按钮"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" QPushButton"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用来做登录、开始 / 停止推流、拉流、播放暂停\n输入框"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" QLineEdit "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用来输入账号、密码、RTMP 地址\n滑动条 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QSlider"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用来做播放进度条和音量调节"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-r3gbf2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-r3gbf2x","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显示和布局"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" QLabel "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显示状态文字、时间、封面图\n界面布局采用了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" qt 的水平布局和网格布局"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-ei4s5kx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-ei4s5kx","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt 中的常用控件怎么使用"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-88rczw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-88rczw0","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QWidget，它是 Qt 里所有界面控件的 “祖宗”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，按钮、输入框、窗口本质上都是它的子类\n可以把它当成一块空白底板 / 容器，所有控件都得放在它上面才能显示\n平时要么直接用它做一个独立窗口，要么把别的控件丢进去统一布局，设置大小、背景、显示隐藏都靠它，相当于界面的底盘"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-f66tgxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-f66tgxa","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在开发中直接从右边工具箱拖控件到窗口："}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-v4ct1pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-v4ct1pp","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按钮（QPushButton），拖过去改个显示文字，比如 “确定”“取消”，然后右键转到槽\n就能写点击后要干啥，比如弹窗、计算、打开文件"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-5uhqty3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-5uhqty3","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入框（QLineEdit） 就是让用户打字的，比如账号、密码\n可以用 text() 拿到用户输入的内容，用 setText(\"内容\") 往里面填文字，还能设置只能输数字、隐藏成密码格式"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-guhaejp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-guhaejp","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"标签（QLabel） 就是显示文字或图片，不能点也不能输，用来放提示语、标题、图标。直接改 text 显示文字，或者用 setPixmap 显示图片"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-as47wi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-as47wi3","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下拉框（QComboBox） 用来做选择，比如性别、城市\n拖出来后，在属性里加选项，或者代码里用 addItem(\"男\") 加，用 currentText() 拿到用户选了啥"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-rdqf25z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-rdqf25z","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复选框 / 单选框（QCheckBox / QRadioButton） 用来打勾、二选一\n判断有没有选中用 isChecked()，想默认勾上就勾属性里的 checked"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-sciotuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-sciotuo","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"列表 / 表格（QListWidget / QTableWidget） 用来展示多条数据\n直接用 addItem 加内容，用 currentRow 知道用户点了哪一行，适合做菜单、记录展示"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-3ny90f3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-3ny90f3","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"qwidget 和 mainwindow 和 QDialog 的区别"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-dud7mbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-dud7mbv","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QWidget 是最基础的空白窗口，啥都没有，就是一块纯面板"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你可以自己往上随便加按钮、布局，适合做自定义界面、小控件容器，或者嵌入到别的窗口里。它没有菜单栏、工具栏、状态栏这些东西，自由度最高"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-n4uxudf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-n4uxudf","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"QMainWindow 是专门做主界面用的，自带一套完整框架：菜单栏、工具栏、状态栏、中心区域、停靠窗口\n我们平时打开软件看到的主窗口基本都是它，适合做整个程序的主界面，不用自己从零搭架子"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-kt7jvwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-kt7jvwy","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"QDialog 就是弹窗、对话框，比如提示框、登录弹窗、设置窗口\n它默认是模态的，弹出来后你不点确定或取消，就没法操作后面的窗口，专门用来做临时交互、确认操作、收集信息，不适合当主窗口"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-8b1nglh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-8b1nglh","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有没有重绘 paintevent"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-val9znh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-val9znh","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"paintEvent() 本质上就是 Qt 给控件留的一个“重绘入口”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n只要这个控件需要刷新，比如第一次显示、窗口被遮挡后重新露出来、尺寸变化，或者你主动调了 update()，Qt 最后都会走到 paintEvent()，让你决定这个控件该怎么画\n一般会在 paintEvent() 里配合 QPainter 去画文字、图片、背景或者自定义样式"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-1s9gltc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-1s9gltc","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的项目里没有自己重写 paintEvent()\n因为视频显示走的是 QOpenGLWidget，对应的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" paintGL()"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n你可以把它理解成：\n普通 Qt 绘制走 paintEvent()，OpenGL 绘制走 paintGL()\n本质上都是重绘入口，只是渲染方式不一样"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-seu88ov","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-seu88ov","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自定义重绘 paintGL()"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-e7ok8hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-e7ok8hq","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每次需要刷新画面时，不是让 Qt 默认帮它画，而是程序自己决定这一帧怎么显示"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-vemtpb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-vemtpb8","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中的做法是：\n先把最新的视频帧保存成 QImage，触发一次重绘\n进入 paintGL() 以后，先清屏，再把这张图上传成 OpenGL 纹理\n最后画一个矩形，把纹理贴上去\n这样窗口里看到的内容，其实就是程序自己一帧一帧贴出来的"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-sa0sd3n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-sa0sd3n","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中播放视频时显示窗口可以随意调整大小，怎么做到的"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-sbofm1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-sbofm1i","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我没有把视频写死在固定尺寸里\n窗口大小一变，OpenGL 会先拿到新的宽高\n然后每次重绘时，再根据当前窗口大小和视频原始尺寸\n重新算出一个按比例缩放后的显示区域，再把视频画进去"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-pkzes4a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-pkzes4a","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 能在子线程更新吗？"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-86ulji4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-86ulji4","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Qt 里，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"UI 控件只能在主线程更新，子线程不能直接操作 UI"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n因为 Qt 的 UI 组件不是线程安全的，底层绘图和事件循环都依赖主线程\n子线程直接改界面会出现崩溃、界面卡死、显示错乱等未定义行为"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-lgxgmp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-lgxgmp0","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际开发里，子线程只负责耗时逻辑，比如网络请求、文件读写、数据计算\n需要更新界面时，通过信号槽把数据抛给主线程\n由主线程的槽函数去修改控件文本、进度、样式等，这是最规范也最安全的方式"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-o0um9h1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-o0um9h1","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用 QT、MFC 和 QT 的区别"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-bynfyzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-bynfyzm","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt 相比 MFC 更适合现代开发，它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"跨平台"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一套代码可在 Windows、Linux、嵌入式等多平台运行\n我的项目在 windows 客户端和服务端 Linux 都采用了 qt 进行开发，qt 也可以写纯 C++ 代码\n并且 qt 有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"信号槽"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等特性，代码解耦、易维护\n自带丰富的 UI、网络、多线程、串口等模块，开发效率高\n而 MFC 仅支持 Windows、框架老旧、API 繁琐且几乎不再更新，所以项目中优先选用 Qt"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-2gc9kd9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-2gc9kd9","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你知道 qt 信号和槽的底层原理吗？"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-hg0m2lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-hg0m2lm","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"信号与槽是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" Qt 实现"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"对象间松耦合通信"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"的核心机制"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n允许一个对象的事件触发，另一个对象的函数执行，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"无需直接关联对象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"C++ 回调要手写函数指针、手动绑定、手动调用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nQt 信号槽只要一句 connect，自动完成所有逻辑，大大简化了回调的复杂度"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-50ha1eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-50ha1eo","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"底层实现"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n使用信号槽的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"类必须继承 QObject 并添加 Q_OBJECT 宏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n编译时 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"moc 元对象编译器"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会扫描该宏，创建信号与槽的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"映射表"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，记录信号名、槽函数名及函数地址\n程序启动后 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QApplication 开启主事件循环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n默认连接下，同线程信号会直接调用槽函数\n跨线程信号才会被封装为事件加入队列，由事件循环通过映射表找到槽并在目标线程执行"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-gqgat3l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-gqgat3l","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt 为什么要设计元对象系统？解决了什么问题？"}]},{"ID":"20260909231809-wte0m28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260909231809-wte0m28","updated":"20260909231809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Qt 设计元对象系统，本质上是为了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补足标准 C++ 在\"运行时自省和对象通信\"方便的不足"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"标准 C++ 虽然有 RTTI"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，能做 typeid、dynamic_cast\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但能力很弱，拿不到一个类有哪些信号、槽、属性"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"也不能在运行时按名字调用成员函数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，更做不好对象之间这种松耦合的事件通信\nQt 为了支撑 GUI 框架、事件驱动编程和跨线程协作，就自己设计了一套元对象系统"}]}]}